{"version":1,"content":"<p>任達華、謝君豪、伍允龍、葉蒨文、孔德賢，昨晚（21日）出席旅發局與無綫製作《香港 連場好戲》節目，任達華在節目中引領觀眾，重遊當年拍攝《歲月神偷》取景的永利街，形容歲月轉變，惟香港人情味不變，並提議在此舉辦戶外演出的舞台劇。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T10:41:23.804255+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":112,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T10:25:27+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T12:46:30.980878+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T10:37:43.698178+00:00","content_hash":"0e649b9f4b7ca6cb76bb41b7b21246367d885dab96a116c7bf7dcbae406d62f7","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}